00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:32.710
MARK MANDEL: Got it.

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:34.168
FRANCESC CAMPOY:
So basically, they

00:04:34.168 --> 00:04:38.120
adapted it so you can use App
Engine and Go Kit together,

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:39.230
which is really cool.

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:41.080
