the code that he

00:27:19.690 --> 00:27:21.691
wrote related to that
functionality and feature.

00:27:21.691 --> 00:27:22.398
MARK MANDEL: Ooh.

00:27:22.398 --> 00:27:22.990
Nice.

00:27:22.990 --> 00:27:24.190
MIKE ALTARACE: The fact
